node_modules/
scratch/
*.log
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

# A live term's harvest is regenerable, so it is not committed: it is 0.5 MB
# that changes every week. data/raw/1262 and data/raw/1264 ARE committed and
# must stay, because those terms have left the API and cannot be refetched at
# any price. The manifest beside the harvest is committed for provenance.
data/harvest-*.json.gz
*.tmp

# Claude Code worktrees and session state
.claude/

# The Learning Spaces classroom pages fetch-room-features.mjs reads: 321 files,
# 12 MB, and refetchable in about six minutes. data/cache/registrar/ is ten
# small pages and stays committed; two of them are this script own. A clean
# checkout rebuilds the Learning Spaces cache on the first run.
data/cache/learningspaces/

# The Roomix cross-check files for #26 are 2.7 MB and refetchable in a second.
# docs/research/ground-truth-walk.md carries the command and the numbers.
rx/

# The SIS room matrix sweep caches one gzipped page per room: 425 files, 5.2 MB
# a week, and the whole sweep refetches in four minutes. data/cache/registrar/
# is 10 files and stays committed. scripts/test/room-events.test.mjs carries the
# grid markup inline so a parser change is still testable without refetching.
data/cache/sis-room-matrix/
